<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mixed in active trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 10.77 to 6843.87, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite was unchanged at 409.31.</p>
<p>The average price per share was unchanged.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1239 to 1242.</p>
<p>Volume was 440,381,990 compared with 532,436,160 on Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
</text>
